<https://astrea.linkeddata.es/shapes#edefab4c5a6c7f1298adbe7978c527d5> a sh:PropertyShape ;
    rdfs:label "The general opening hours for a business. Opening hours can be specified as a weekly time range, starting with days, then times per day. Multiple days can be listed with commas ',' separating each day. Day or time ranges are specified using a hyphen '-'."@en,
